+ * cbm_config.c encodes the un-remapped jumbo channels 16 (p7) / 31 (p8), but
+ * AVM sets cbm_rev=2 unconditionally (cbm.c:5597) before configure_ports(),
+ * which activates the A21 jumbo remap in conf_eqm_dma_port (cbm.c:5284):
+ * `dma_chnl = (dma_chnl == 16) ? 6 : 11`. So p7 jumbo = DMA1RX ch6, p8 jumbo
